<ul>
<li>His great-grandfather opened the Hayes Hotel in Woodlawn and his grandfather was a Chicago police officer. (<a href="https://www.newswire.com/news/john-kelly-launches-campaign-for-mayor-of-chicago-pledges-to-restore-22835571" rel="nofollow noopener">newswire.com</a>)</li>
